!!! Ownership operations are STATEMENTS, not values. Ny accepts an ownership
!!! operation only as a direct local declaration initialiser, so there is no
!!! expression form to lower to; expressing that as a parse rule means the
!!! rejection lands on the construct rather than surfacing later as a type
!!! error on a value that never existed.
book bad.ownership

main returns number begin paragraph
    own variable samples as array of number sized 4
    value copy is own variable samples as array of number sized 4
    say move samples into final
    give 0
end paragraph
